{#- The `lang` attribute of an article written in a language other than the
    site's (TASK-154), with its leading space, and nothing for one in the
    site's own: the `<html lang>` already names that. Imported with context,
    since the site's language is what it compares against. -#}
{% macro attr(tag) -%}
{%- if tag and tag != (site.language | default("en")) %} lang="{{ tag }}"{% endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}
